    {
      "id": "ukraine-2",
      "name": "Field Boundaries",
      "isActive": true,
      "meta": {
        "description": "This interactive map shows field boundaries across all major European Countries generated using the **Delineate Anything v2** algorithm applied to the 2025 summer season Sentinel-2 Global Mosaics (S2GM), with the WorldCereal 2021 map used as a delineation mask.\n\n To view the field boundaries, zoom in to a local in a country of your choice. The boundaries are displayed on the map when the scalebar in the bottom left displays 5 km or less.\n\n**Please note** that the field boundaries are overlaid on high-resolution satellite imagery from the Stadia Maps service. As a result, some misalignment may be visible, since the boundaries were derived from Sentinel-2 data.\n\n### Further information\nDetails of methodology are available on the [Delineate Anything Project Page](https://lavreniuk.github.io/Delineate-Anything/)\n\n### Authors\n[Mykola Lavreniuk](https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&user=-oFR-RYAAAAJ) (1,2), [Nataliia Kussul](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=e3TWBuwAAAAJ&hl=en) (3), [Andrii Shelestov](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=tqoQKZAAAAAJ&hl=en) (2,4), [Bohdan Yailymov](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=XaN-oukAAAAJ&hl=en) (2), [Yevhenii Salii](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=4jgAsBIAAAAJ&hl=en) (2,4), [Volodymyr Kuzin](https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Volodymyr-Kuzin) (2,4), [Zoltan Szantoi](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=P_pyhi8AAAAJ&hl=en) (1)\n\n[1] European Space Agency, [2] SRI NASU-SSAU, [3] University of Maryland, [4] Igor Sikorsky Kyiv Polytechnic Institute",
        "attribution": {
          "text": "Delineate Anything"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "interfaceGroup": "Example Datasets",
        "contentLocation": "infoPanel",
        "infoPanel": {
